# GrowDose Hardware Bill of Materials

Bill of materials for the current three-channel GrowDose prototype.

## Controller

| Qty | Component                             | Specification / Notes               |
| --: | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
|   1 | ESP32-S3 UNO-format development board | ESP32-S3, UNO R3 form factor, USB-C |
|   1 | CNC Shield V3                         | UNO-compatible CNC shield           |
|   3 | A4988 stepper driver modules          | One driver per dosing pump          |

## Dosing Pumps

| Qty | Component            | Specification / Notes                                       |
| --: | -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
|   3 | Stepper dosing pumps | NEMA-style stepper-driven dosing pumps, approximately 1.3 A |

## Power

| Qty | Component            | Specification / Notes                  |
| --: | -------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
|   1 | 12 V DC power supply | Supplies the stepper drivers and pumps |
|   1 | USB-C supply/cable   | Powers the ESP32-S3 controller         |

