## A4988 Configuration

All three A4988 drivers are currently configured for **1/8 microstepping**:

| Setting | State |
| ------- | ----- |
| M0      | ON    |
| M1      | ON    |
| M2      | OFF   |

With a typical 200-step/revolution motor:

**1600 steps/revolution**

## Controller Pinout

| Function            |   GPIO |
| ------------------- | -----: |
| Pump A STEP         | GPIO18 |
| Pump A DIR          | GPIO20 |
| Pump B STEP         | GPIO17 |
| Pump B DIR          |  GPIO3 |
| Pump C STEP         | GPIO19 |
| Pump C DIR          | GPIO14 |
| Shared A4988 ENABLE | GPIO21 |

## Current Hardware Status

The following has been physically tested and confirmed:

* ESP32-S3 controller operating correctly
* CNC Shield operating correctly
* All three A4988 drivers operating correctly
* All three pumps operating correctly
* All three pumps tested in forward and reverse
* Shared driver enable control working
* Motors release when the drivers are disabled

